<title>LITHUANIA: TENNIS-YUGOSLAVIA BEAT LITHUANIA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-YUGOSLAVIA BEAT LITHUANIA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yugoslavia beat Lithuania 3-2 in a</p>
<p>Euro/Africa zone group two Davis Cup third round tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results of Sunday's reverse singles (Lithuanian names</p>
<p>first):</p>
<p>Rolandas Murashka beat Bojan Vujic 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Eugenijus Cariovas beat Vladimir Pavicevic 7-6 (7-5) 4-6 6-3</p>
</text>
